  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transforming Political Parties and Democratic Institutions: Support to Westminster Foundation for Democracy (WFD)&apos;s integrated approach to party-to-party, cross-party and parliamentary assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Transforming Political Parties and Democratic Institutions: Support to Westminster Foundation for Democracy (WFD)&apos;s integrated approach to party-to-party, cross-party and parliamentary assistance is a component of Transforming Political Parties and Democratic Institutions reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;5,226,571. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Legislatures and political parties, Democratic participation and civil society, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
